# shadcn Install Target (Monorepo)

This repository contains multiple valid shadcn projects (`apps/web` and `packages/ui`), each with its own `components.json`.

## Rules

- Never assume install target when a shadcn install request is ambiguous.
- If the user does not explicitly name a target package/path, ask which project should receive the component before running `shadcn add`.
- If the user explicitly names the target, install only in that target.

## Guidance when asking

- Shared/reusable UI primitives and components -> `packages/ui`
- App-specific blocks/composed sections/pages -> `apps/web`
